      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "2026:KER:17537 CRL.M.C.NO.620 OF 2026 3. At this stage, the learned counsel for the petitioner prayed for giving a direction to the learned Sessions Judge to dispose of this case in a time bound manner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
